msgstr "Kernel tuvastas HDD/SSD seadmena"

msgid "Path to all required directories like picon, piconProv and more."
msgstr "Kõigi vajalike kaustade (picon, piconProv jm) asukohatee"

msgid "User defined path to all required directories like picon, piconProv and more."
msgstr "Kasutaja määratud asukohatee kõigile vajalikele kaustadele (picon, piconProv jm)"

